UPDATE companies SET description='Sentra-Sota Sheet Metal, Inc. was founded on May 26, 1982, by Ben Bechtold and Jerry Vogt in Waite Park, Minnesota. The name reflects their central Minnesota roots, and the business began in the founders'' garages before moving to a dedicated shop on Roosevelt Road in St. Cloud in 1984.

The company operates a full-service custom sheet metal fabrication shop and a dedicated HVAC system fabrication and installation department at its current 3075 3rd Street South facility. Its capabilities cover architectural sheet metal, commercial HVAC ductwork, and custom metal products for projects ranging from large multi-story buildings to single-room installations.

Sentra-Sota serves industrial, manufacturing, commercial property developers, medical facilities, food service, educational facilities, retail outlets, and residential customers throughout central Minnesota. The firm has worked on multiple LEED-registered projects and counts commercial, industrial, and residential buildings among its installed work.

