UPDATE companies SET description='Sigenics, Inc. was founded in 2010 and is headquartered in Chicago, Illinois, with an additional design center in Los Osos, California. The company began as a specialist in custom integrated circuit design for sensor, analog, and mixed-signal applications, leveraging the collective experience of its engineering team.

Sigenics provides turnkey ASIC development services that span specification, design, simulation, layout, and test. The firm maintains in-house test facilities and coordinates with manufacturing partners to deliver finished integrated circuits. Its engineering focus includes sensor interface design, CMOS design, power management, and analog and mixed-signal circuits. The company also offers reverse-engineering services to produce form-fit-function replacements for obsolete parts.

The company serves military and aerospace programs, medical device manufacturers, and industrial automation customers. In the defense sector, Sigenics has developed custom devices for legacy avionics systems and complex ASICs for commercial and military-grade equipment. Its medical portfolio includes neural stimulation and signal acquisition chips for wearable and implantable devices. Industrial clients engage the firm for power management and sensor interface ICs used in automated electronic equipment.

Sigenics positions its turnkey model as the easiest path to ASIC production, emphasizing that its in-house experts, test facilities, and qualified manufacturing partners ensure production quality. The company holds ISO 9001, AS9100, and ITAR certifications, supporting high-reliability requirements across its served markets.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','AS9100','ITAR']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom integrated circuit design", "ASIC design and development", "Turnkey ASIC supply", "Sensor interface design", "CMOS design", "Power management design", "Analog and mixed-signal design", "Reverse engineering", "Obsolete part replacement", "Testing and validation", "Specification, simulation, and layout", "Manufacturing coordination"], "industries": ["Military & Aerospace", "Medical", "Industrial"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Turnkey ASIC development from specification through test", "In-house test facilities and qualified manufacturing partners", "Reverse engineering for obsolete part replacement", "ISO 9001, AS9100, and ITAR certified", "Expertise in military, medical, and industrial high-reliability applications"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2010 -> db", "Headquarters Chicago, IL -> /", "Additional design center Los Osos, CA -> /", "Specializes in custom IC design for sensor, analog, mixed-signal -> /", "Turnkey ASIC services including specification, design, simulation, layout, test -> /", "In-house test facilities and manufacturing partners -> /", "Services: sensor interface design, CMOS design, power management, analog/mixed-signal -> /", "Reverse engineering for obsolete part replacement -> /", "Industries: Military & Aerospace, Medical, Industrial -> /", "Military: legacy avionics, commercial/military-grade equipment -> /", "Medical: neural stimulation, signal acquisition, wearables, implantables -> /", "Industrial: power management, sensor interface ICs for automation -> /", "Certif