UPDATE companies SET description='Stantek Contract Manufacturing operates from Stanton, Kentucky, just outside Lexington. The company was founded in 2003, though the site had been a Sanmina-SCI contract manufacturing facility until production moved to Mexico that year. In 2017, the Stantek and Monticello teams combined to better support rapid-turnaround replacement parts for major customers'' distribution centers. The business was acquired in July 2025 but remains privately held and continues full operations in Kentucky.

Stantek produces wire harnesses, cable assemblies, control cables, electro-mechanical assemblies, and mechanical assemblies. In-house capabilities include high-volume wire processing (cutting, stripping, termination), laser/ink-jet/hot-stamp wire printing, machine braiding, ultrasonic welding (Branson and Techsonic systems), custom Cirris and electrical testing (Fluke instruments), hydraulic press work, machining, tooling and die maintenance, and inventory management. The facility spans 30,000 square feet of manufacturing and warehouse space with 50-plus personnel. The company specializes in low-to-mid-volume, short-run programs and rapid prototyping, with standard wire and connectors stocked for immediate production.

Stantek serves aerospace, military, industrial, robotics, marine, medical, and automotive sectors. Military and aerospace customers include key tier-one government contractors and large commercial aviation OEMs. Industrial clients include major material-handling OEMs and fork-truck OEMs (as referenced in testimonials). Medical equipment manufacturers rely on Stantek for interconnect solutions. The company is ITAR registered (DDTC, Cage Code 14EW7) and manufactures to USML standards.

Stantek emphasizes a 99.9% quality assurance rate under ISO 9001:2015, a 95%+ on-time in-full delivery rate, and over 100 years of combined team experience in harness and assembly manufacturing. The company positions itself on flexible, rapid-turnaround manufacturing without compromising quality, supported by in-house capabilities that enable quick response.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ITAR (DDTC registered)','WHMA-A620','J-STD-001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Wire harness assembly", "Cable assembly", "Electro-mechanical assembly", "Mechanical assembly", "Wire cutting, stripping, and preparation", "Wire termination", "Wire printing (laser, ink jet, hot stamp)", "Machine braiding", "Ultrasonic welding/splicing", "Cirris testing", "Electrical testing (Fluke instruments)", "Tensile strength testing", "Hydraulic press services", "In-house machining", "Tooling and die maintenance", "Inventory and materials management", "Rapid prototyping", "Quick-turn production", "Terminal application (standard and pico presses)", "Connector and component sourcing (Molex, TE Connectivity)"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Military", "Industrial", "Robotics", "Marine", "Medical", "Automotive"], "materials": ["Wire", "Cable", "Connectors (Molex, TE Connectivity)", "Terminals"], "equipment": ["Cirris testing systems", "Fluke instruments", "Branson ultrasonic welders", "Techsonic ultrasonic welders", "Terminal presses (standard and pico)", "Laser wire printing equipment", "Hot stamp wire printing equipment", "Ink jet wire printing equipment", "Machine braid equipment", "Hydraulic presses"], "volume": "Low-mid volume, short-run; prototype to volume", "lead_time": "Rapid turnaround; immediate production for stocked standard wire and connectors", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["99.9% quality assurance under ISO 9001:2015", "95%+ on-time in-full delivery rate", "Low-mid volume, fast-turnaround specialization", "ITAR registered (DDTC, Cage Code 14EW7)", "100+ years combined team experience", "Standard wire and connectors stocked for immediate production"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2003 -> /about", "Location Stanton, KY -> /about", "30,000 sq ft facility -> /", "50+ personnel -> /", "ISO 9001:2015 certified -> /", "ITAR registered, Cage code 14EW7 -> /", "Low-mid volume, fast turnaround -> /", "Industries: Aerospace, Military, Industrial, Robotics, Marine, Medical, Automotive -> /", "Capabilities: wire harness, cable assembly, electro-mechanical, mechanical -> /", "Equipment: Cirris, Fluke, Branson, Techsonic, terminal presses, laser/hot stamp/ink jet printing, machine braid, hydraulic press -> /", "Materials: wire, connectors (Molex, TE Connectivity) -> /", "Acquired July 2025, remains privately held -> /about", "Monticello team joined 2017 -> /about", "Sanmina-SCI site history -> /about", "99.9% quality assurance -> /", "95%+ on-time delivery -> /", "100+ years combined experience -> /", "Stock standard wire and connectors -> /", "In-house machining, tooling, hydraulic press -> /services", "Wire printing services -> /services", "Machine braiding -> /services", "Terminal application -> /services", "Ultrasonic splicing -> /services", "Cirris testing -> /services", "Electrical testing -> /services", "Tensile strength testing -> /services", "Hydraulic press services -> /services", "Tooling & dies -> /services", "Rapid prototyping and quick turn -> /services", "Wire & cable stock -> /services", "Terminal inventory -> /services", "Connectors & components -> /services"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Stantek Contract Manufacturing is a US based supplier of rapid turnaround, high quality wire harnesses, cable assemblies, control cables and mechanical assemblies.", "founded_year": "2003", "employee_count": "50+", "cage_code": "14EW7", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": ["ITAR registered", "DDTC registered"], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, upd