UPDATE companies SET description='Stonewall Cable, Inc. was founded in 1985 in Rumney, New Hampshire, as a family business that began assembling cables in the living room of a country home. The company remains family-owned and operates from its facility in Rumney.

The company manufactures a wide range of custom cable assemblies and harnesses, including fiber optic cables (singlemode and multimode OM1–OM4), military-specification circular and fiber connectors, encryption device cables (KIV-7, KG-94, KIV-19, KIV-21, STU-III/STE), network cables (Category 5e, 6, 6a UTP/STP), coaxial assemblies (BNC, 735A, DS0/DS1, T1), RJ21/Telco 50/64-pair cables, and OEM-equivalent cables for vendors such as Cisco, Juniper, and Hewlett Packard. Assemblies are built to custom lengths with jacket options including PVC, plenum, riser, and low-smoke zero-halogen, and the firm supports orders from prototype through production runs.

Its customer base includes top defense contractors and federal buyers, with products qualified under Federal Supply Class codes and NAICS 334419.

The company emphasizes its commitment to American manufacturing, citing family values, employee trust, continual improvement, and community involvement—including annual Toys for Tots drives and participation in IBM’s World Community Grid—as core differentiators. It maintains ITAR registration, ISO 9001 certification, and TAA/BAA and RoHS/REACH compliance for most products.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ITAR','RoHS']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cable assembly and harness manufacturing", "Fiber optic cable assembly (singlemode and multimode)", "Mil-spec circular connector assembly", "Mil-spec fiber optic assembly", "Encryption device cable assembly (KIV-7, KG-94, KIV-19, KIV-21, STU-III/STE)", "Network cable assembly (Category 5e, 6, 6a UTP/STP)", "Coaxial cable assembly (BNC, 735A, DS0/DS1, T1)", "RJ21/Telco 50/64 pair cable assembly", "OEM equivalent cable assembly (Cisco, Juniper, HP, IBM, etc.)", "Serial/SCSI/USB/IDE cable assembly", "Design and engineering support", "Prototype to production runs", "ITAR compliance", "TAA/BAA compliance", "RoHS/REACH compliance"], "industries": ["Defense", "Government", "Broadcast", "Industrial", "Telecommunications", "Networking", "Encryption/Security"], "materials": ["PVC", "Plenum-rated jacket", "LSZH jacket", "Riser-rated jacket", "Singlemode fiber (9/125)", "Multimode fiber (OM1, OM2, OM3, OM4)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom cable assemblies available in any length", "ITAR registered and TAA/BAA compliant", "ISO 9001 certified quality system", "Family-owned US manufacturing with in-house design capability", "Prototype to production runs using quality components"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1985 -> db", "Headquarters Rumney, NH -> db", "Family-owned -> /about-us", "Cage code 1PHQ9 -> /", "ISO 9001, ITAR, RoHS certifications -> db", "Custom cable assemblies any length -> /", "Fiber optic capabilities (singlemode, multimode OM1-OM4) -> /", "Mil-spec ci