UPDATE companies SET description='Structural Metal Fabricators, Inc. (SMF) was founded in 1979 by Lee A. Held in Palmerton, Pennsylvania. The company began as a service provider for the region''s heavy industry and has since expanded to a campus exceeding 61,000 square feet that houses manufacturing, engineering, sales, service, and a parts showroom.

SMF specializes in custom fabrication for work trucks and trailers, offering CNC machining, full hydraulic service, and vehicle and equipment sales, upfit, repair, and maintenance. The operation produces aerial devices, utility equipment, and custom interiors, handling projects ranging from single bespoke units to full fleet builds for commercial clients.

The company serves the energy solutions sector along with individual contractors, specialized trades, and commercial fleets.

SMF emphasizes a truly custom approach rather than modifying off-the-shelf bodies, collaborating with clients to engineer solutions matched to their exact operations. The firm cites its use of high-quality materials, robust fabrication techniques, and an experienced team of engineers and craftsmen as the basis for durable, long-lasting products.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom fabrication", "CNC machining", "Hydraulic system service and repair", "Vehicle upfitting", "Equipment sales", "Vehicle repair and maintenance"], "industries": ["Energy Solutions"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Truly custom fabrication, not off-the-shelf modifications", "Collaboration to engineer solutions matched to exact workflows", "High-quality materials and robust fabrication for longevity", "Experienced engineers and craftsmen solving complex challenges", "61,000+ sq ft facility with manufacturing, engineering, sales, service, and parts showroom"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1979 by Lee A. Held -> /about-us", "Headquarters in Palmerton, Pennsylvania -> db", "Facility over 61,000 sq ft with manufacturing, engineering, sales, service, parts showroom -> /about-us", "ISO 9001 certified -> db", "Custom fabrication for work trucks and trailers -> /", "CNC machining capabilities -> /, db", "Full hydraulic service department -> /, db", "Vehicle & equipment sales, upfit, repair, maintenance -> /, db", "Products: aerial devices, utility equipment, custom interiors -> /", "Serves energy solutions industry -> db", "Serves contractors, commercial fleets, specialized trades -> /", "Emphasis on truly custom, not off-the-shelf -> /", "Collaboration with clients to engineer solutions -> /", "High-quality materials, robust fabrication techniques -> /", "Experienced team of engineers and skilled craftsmen -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "SMF was