UPDATE companies SET description='Suntronic is an electronics manufacturing services (EMS) provider headquartered in Richardson, Texas, with production facilities in Houston and Dallas.

It offers a full range of contract manufacturing services, including quick-turn PCB assembly (with 24-hour prototype capability), box-build integration, cable and wire-harness assembly, electromechanical assembly, conformal coating, and functional testing. Operations run out of more than 100,000 square feet of factory space, supporting volumes from low-volume pilot runs to high-volume production. The company cites state-of-the-art equipment and technical expertise as foundations of its service offering.

The company serves customers in oil and gas, industrial controls, communications, infrastructure, and original equipment manufacturers (OEMs) that require mission-critical electronic assemblies for harsh environments.

Suntronic emphasizes quality built into the process rather than inspected in, maintaining ISO 9001:2015 certification and IPC-A-610-trained personnel. Its stated mission is to develop mutually profitable partnerships and to provide a challenging, rewarding workplace for employees.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ROHS','IPC-A-610']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electronics Manufacturing Services", "PCB Assembly", "Box Build Assembly", "Low Pressure Injection Over Molding", "Electronics Contract Manufacturing", "Electronics Testing", "Mixed Model Assembly", "PCB Conformal Coating", "Consumer Electronics Fulfillment", "Cable and Wire Harness Assembly", "Electromechanical Assembly", "Through-Hole PCB Assembly", "High Volume PCB Assembly", "Low Volume PCB Assembly", "Quick Turn PCB Assembly", "Turnkey PCB Assembly", "Consigned PCB Assembly", "Rapid Prototyping", "New Product Introduction", "PCB Assembly Optical Inspection"], "industries": ["Oil and Gas", "Industrial Controls", "Communications", "Infrastructure", "OEMs"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to full production (24-hour prototype available)", "lead_time": "24-hour prototype turnaround", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["24-hour prototype turnaround", "100,000+ sq ft manufacturing space", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality system", "IPC-A-610 certified personnel", "Full-range EMS from prototype to high-volume production"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1995 -> db", "Headquarters in Richardson, Texas -> db", "Facilities in Houston and Dallas -> /", "100,000+ square feet factory space -> /", "ISO 9001:2015 certification -> /quality", "ROHS certification -> db", "IPC-A-610 certified personnel -> /quality", "Services: PCB assembly, box build, cable/wire harness, testing, conformal coating -> db capabilities and /", "Industries served: Oil and Gas, industrial controls, communications, infrastructure, OEMs -> db description", "Quick-turn 24-hour prototype -> /", "Mission: building partne