UPDATE companies SET description='TDI Custom Packaging operates from Santa Ana, California, where it has produced custom polyethylene packaging since 1974. The company was founded by Anthony "Tony" Deniger, who began with blown-film extrusion in El Monte before moving to Orange County. It remains a family-owned business, with management directly accessible to customers.

The shop extrudes, converts, and prints a range of high- and low-density polyethylene films, bags, sleeves, tubing, and sheeting. It runs blown-film lines capable of widths from 1 to 42 inches and lengths up to 196 inches, and offers flexographic printing up to four colors on one side or two colors on two sides. Minimum orders start at 100 pounds for narrower widths, and the company emphasizes smaller quantity runs with a current lead time of about four weeks.

TDI serves nurseries with grow bags and plant sleeves, the medical market with gel ice bags, and a broad base of industrial packagers. Long-term customers include a nursery client since 1991 and buyers who have ordered regularly since 1976 and 2000.

The founder''s stated philosophy is to supply hard-to-find custom sizes, colors, and formulations that large extruders and importers do not stock. The company highlights its family-owned structure, direct decision-making, FDA-approved resins, and compliance with AQMD and EPA standards as differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY['FDA-approved resins']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Blown-film extrusion", "Converting (bag making, tubing, sheeting)", "Flexographic printing (up to 4 colors one side, 2 colors two sides)", "Custom film extrusion (high clarity, liner grade, FDA-approved)", "Specialty resin blending (EVA, linear low-density polyethylene)", "Small quantity production runs"], "industries": ["Nursery", "Medical/Healthcare (gel ice bags)", "General custom packaging"], "materials": ["FDA-approved polyethylene resins", "High-density polyethylene (HDPE)", "Low-density polyethylene (LDPE)", "EVA blends", "Linear low-density polyethylene (LLDPE) blends"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Minimum runs 100\u2013500 lbs by width; smaller custom runs accommodated", "lead_time": "Approximately 4 weeks", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["High quality, lower minimum orders, shorter lead times than most", "Specializes in small quantity production runs", "Offers custom sizes, colors, and formulations not readily available from large extruders", "Uses premium FDA-approved resins"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1974 -> db", "Headquarters Santa Ana, CA -> db", "Founder Anthony ''Tony'' Deniger -> /about", "Family-owned -> /about (testimonial)", "Blown-film extrusion, converting, printing -> /about, /capabilities", "Minimum runs by width -> /capabilities", "Lead time approx 4 weeks -> /capabilities", "FDA-approved resins -> /about, /capabilities", "Industries: nursery, gel bags -> /capabilities, /about", "Philosophy: hard-to-find custom sizes, colors, formulations -> /capabilities (Tony Deniger quote)", "Environmentally conscious, AQMD/EPA compliance -> /about"], "company_type": "Manuf