UPDATE companies SET description='Tru-Tronics International operates from North Las Vegas, Nevada, where it was founded in 1996 as an assembly contractor specializing in electronic printed circuit assemblies, mechanical wire harnesses, and wire-wrap assemblies. The company has grown into one of the Las Vegas Valley’s providers of advanced assembly services.

Its core manufacturing services include custom and molded cable assemblies, printed circuit board assembly using both through-hole and surface-mount technology, box-build integration, conformal coating, chip and device programming, and RoHS conversion or compliant production. The facility supports small to high-volume, high-mix runs and offers both consignment and turnkey manufacturing models.

The company serves military contractors and subcontractors, OEMs, and electronic development projects, leveraging a Department of Defense registration and a military cage code. It also assists purchasing departments with board-level component needs, supplying obsolete and discontinued parts alongside a large in-stock inventory.

Tru-Tronics emphasizes a knowledgeable sales staff with decades of experience, on-time delivery with just-in-time scheduling, engineering and technical support, and lean manufacturing processes. Environmental practices such as ODS/VOC elimination and scrap recycling reflect its stated commitment to employee health and safety.', certifications=ARRAY['RoHS']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom electronic cable assemblies", "Molded electronic cable assemblies", "Obsolete electronic components sourcing", "Chip programming", "Conformal coatings", "RoHS compliant manufacturing", "RoHS conversion", "Anti-RoHS separation and control", "Through-hole assembly", "Surface mount technology (SMT)", "Box build / cable assembly", "Kanban control", "Device programming", "Cable harness assembly", "Electronic static control", "Dry packing", "Consignment manufacturing", "Turnkey manufacturing", "Fast prototyping", "High-speed quality assembly", "Component selection and supply chain management", "Lean manufacturing processes", "Printed circuit board assembly"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Small to high volume runs", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Knowledgeable sales staff with 25+ years of experience", "Large selection of in-stock inventory for immediate shipment", "On-time delivery supported by just-in-time scheduling", "Engineering and technical support for component substitution and design", "RoHS compliant manufacturing and conversion services"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1996 -> /about", "Location North Las Vegas, NV -> /, /about-us, /about", "Assembly contractor specializing in electronic printed circuit assemblies, mechanical wire harness and wire wrap assembly -> /about", "State-of-the-art PCB assembly facility -> /about", "Small to high volume high-mix electronic PCB assemblies -> /about", "Custom electronic cable assemblies and molded electronic cable assemblies -> /", "Obsolete electronic components sourcing -> /", "C