UPDATE companies SET description='Van Ness Plastic Molding Co. was founded in 1945 in Clifton, New Jersey, and has remained a family-owned and operated business for more than 70 years.

Today, Van Ness manufactures a range of pet products including litter boxes, carriers, and bamboo-based accessories under lines such as Calm Carrier, Trackless Litter Mat Tiles, and Ecoware. Production uses FDA-approved materials with full traceability to source, and the company emphasizes that all items are made in the United States.

Its customer base includes pet owners seeking domestically produced, safety-focused items; testimonials highlight high-sided litter pans that reduce scatter and carriers that lessen travel anxiety.

