UPDATE companies SET description='Veterans Trading Company (VTC) is headquartered in Ocala, Florida, where its primary Supplier Managed Inventory (SMI) facility operates, with additional presence across seven states. The company was founded in 2005 by a team of supply chain and industrial distribution veterans who set out to deliver the right product to the right location at the precise time it was needed. It is certified as a Service-Disabled Veteran-Owned Small Business.

Its core services include Supplier Managed Inventory (SMI) — covering purchasing, incoming inspection, solder and steam age testing, kitting, bulk breakdown, and value-added operations such as lead bending and trimming — as well as On-Site Procurement (OSP) and Customer Direct Procurement (CDP). The company also supplies a broad range of industrial MRO products.

VTC serves commercial firms and federal prime contractors, with a strong concentration in the aerospace and defense sectors.

The business was built on a “Best In Class” service principle that still drives its quality management system, which employs DMAIC Six Sigma methods across all processes. VTC highlights its ISO 9100:2015 and AS9100D certifications, its veteran-owned status, and a track record of industry awards for innovative supply chain models that deliver measurable productivity gains and cost savings.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9100:2015','AS9100D','Service-Disabled Veteran-Owned Small Business']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Supplier Managed Inventory (SMI)", "On-Site Procurement (OSP)", "Customer Direct Procurement Services (CDP)", "Industrial Products and Supplies (MRO)", "Purchasing", "Incoming inspection", "Solder and steam age testing", "Kitting", "Bulk break down", "Value-add (lead bend & trim)", "Supply chain solutions", "Procurement support programs"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Defense", "Federal government", "Commercial industrial"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["ISO 9100:2015 and AS9100D certified (Certificate Number 15144)", "Supplier Managed Inventory with purchasing, inspection, solder/steam age testing, kitting, and value-add operations", "On-Site Procurement and Customer Direct Procurement service models", "Service-Disabled Veteran-Owned Small Business status", "Strategic partnerships with Lockheed Martin, Boeing, Northrop Grumman, and BAE Systems"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Ocala, Florida -> /about", "Founded in 2005 -> /about, db", "Service-Disabled Veteran-Owned Small Business -> /, db", "Founders with supply chain and industrial distribution experience -> /about", "Core services: SMI, OSP, CDP, MRO -> /", "SMI includes purchasing, incoming inspection, solder and steam age testing, kitting, bulk break down, value-add (lead bend & trim) -> /", "Operates in seven states -> /about", "Partnerships with Lockheed Martin, Boeing, Northrop Grumman, BAE Systems -> /about", "ISO 9100:20