UPDATE companies SET description='A&A Manufacturing has operated from Spring Lake, Michigan since its founding in 1966. The family‑owned business began with a simple goal: produce hard‑to‑find chassis tabs, mounts, and hardware domestically so racers and fabricators could focus on building better vehicles.

The company manufactures a range of chassis components for racing and off‑road applications, including suspension mounts, shock mounts, engine and transmission mounts, braking hardware, gussets, fasteners, and heim joints. A single facility houses both production and a walk‑in showroom, and in‑stock orders can ship same‑day nationwide.

Customers include race teams, hot‑rod builders, off‑road enthusiasts, professional technicians, and fabrication shops — anyone who needs weld‑ready components with consistent fitment. The shop also supports DIY racers and technician shops with custom one‑off or short‑run tabs, brackets, and specialty mounts, offering guidance on material selection and design trade‑offs.

A&A emphasizes domestic manufacturing as a differentiator: controlling materials, tolerances, and finish in its own shop yields repeatable hole sizing, bend accuracy, and weld‑ready edges. Local sourcing for the remaining items allows quick scaling of specialty runs without compromising quality, and the team provides responsive support from people who know the parts because they make them.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Precision stamping", "Laser cutting", "Machining", "Fabrication", "Custom one-off and short-run production", "Custom tab, bracket, and mount variations", "Material selection guidance", "Design trade-off consultation"], "industries": ["Racing", "Off-road", "Hot rod", "Fabrication shops", "Motorsports"], "materials": ["Plated steel", "Steel", "Aluminum", "Hardware"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day dispatch on in-stock items; custom turnaround coordinated with timeline", "tolerances": "Tight tolerances; consistent hole sizing and bend accuracy", "built_on": ["90% of catalog produced in-house", "Same-day dispatch on in-stock orders", "Walk-in showroom pickup available", "Custom one-off and short-run components", "Tight tolerances with weld-ready edges"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1966, family-owned, Spring Lake, Michigan -> /about-us", "Manufactures ~90% in-house, sources locally -> /", "Products: chassis components for racing/off-road (mounts, brackets, hardware, gussets, fasteners, heim joints) -> /about-us", "Processes: precision-stamped, laser-cut, machining, fabrication -> /", "Same-day dispatch on in-stock orders, walk-in showroom pickup -> /", "Custom one-off/short-run components, design guidance -> /", "Industries: racing, off-road, hot rod, fabrication shops -> /about-us", "Materials: plated steel, steel, aluminum from product examples -> /", "Tolerances: tight tolerances, consistent hole sizing, bend accuracy, weld-ready edges -> /about-us", "No certifications, equipment, employee count, CAGE 