UPDATE companies SET description='ACE Solar was founded in 2015 in North Andover, Massachusetts. The company began with residential and commercial solar installations before expanding into utility-scale projects, operating as an independent engineering, procurement, and construction (EPC) contractor for solar energy systems. No founders are named in the source material, and ownership structure is not specified.

The firm provides full-lifecycle solar services: engineering, site design, procurement, pre-construction, construction, and operational management. It also installs energy storage systems and offers operations and maintenance (O&M) for both commercial and residential arrays. The company operates from its North Andover headquarters and additional offices in North Oxford, MA; Biddeford, ME; Atkinson, NH; Silver Springs, MD; and New York City, NY.

ACE Solar serves commercial, industrial, government, and utility-scale clients across New England and beyond. Project types include rooftop arrays for small businesses, school installations, parking garage canopies, landfill redevelopment, and ground-mount solar farms. The company also provides maintenance services for existing residential and commercial systems.

